# Storytime Library needs NO secrets and NO environment variables to run.
#
# The only optional variable is the sub-path base for hosts that don't serve
# from the domain root (e.g. GitHub Pages project sites):
#
#   BASE_PATH=/storyteller/
#
# Leave it unset for Cloudflare Pages, Netlify, or any root-domain host.
# CHROMIUM_PATH may be set to point Playwright at a custom Chromium binary
# when running e2e tests outside the default environment.
